    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body width="600px" background-color="#eeeeee">
    <mj-wrapper background-color="#ffffff" padding="0">
      <mj-section padding="24px 30px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image href="https://www.ezovion.com/" src="assets/ezovion-wordmark.png" alt="Ezovion" width="174px" align="left" padding="0" css-class="mobile-center" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image src="assets/ezovion-human-care-hero.jpg" alt="Doctor and nurse speaking with a patient in a hospital room" width="600px" fluid-on-mobile="true" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#621742" padding="34px 34px 36px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="34px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.7px" line-height="41px" padding-bottom="16px" css-class="mobile-title">
            Upgrade Alert: Smarter Workflows, Global Scale &amp; Next-Gen AI in Ezovion HIMS
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="16px" line-height="26px">
            Modern hospitals thrive when bedside care and back-office governance move in perfect sync. Ezovion continues to remove friction across every touchpoint, from inpatient billing to clinical intelligence.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="38px 34px 36px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="15%" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-family="Georgia, Times, serif" font-size="56px" line-height="46px">“</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="85%">
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="24px" font-weight="700" line-height="31px" padding-bottom="15px">
            A Message from CEO: Building the Frictionless, Connected Hospital
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d">
            A truly connected hospital runs on two synchronized engines: clinical excellence at the bedside and frictionless governance in the back office. When inventory disconnects, payment reconciliations, or administrative delays creep in, it is the patient experience and clinical focus that suffer. Our latest updates, from real-time EHR pharmacy visibility and automated device vitals to upfront billing estimates, are built with a singular focus: stripping away manual friction so your teams can dedicate their energy where it matters most: delivering timely, superior patient care. Thank you for partnering with Ezovion as we continue to shape the future of intelligent, patient-centric healthcare.
          </mj-text>
          <mj-table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" role="presentation">
            <tr>
              <td width="62" valign="middle" style="padding:16px 12px 0 0;">
                <img src="assets/kasi-shanmugam.jpg" alt="Kasi Viswanathan Shanmugam" width="54" height="54" style="display:block;width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #fce8fa;" />
              </td>
              <td valign="middle" style="padding:16px 0 0;color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;line-height:20px;">
                <strong style="color:#621742;font-size:15px;">Kasi Viswanathan Shanmugam</strong><br />
                <span style="font-size:13px;">CEO</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="28px 34px 20px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="44%" padding="0 18px 0 0" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" line-height="34px">
            What’s New in<br />Ezovion HIMS
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="56%">
          <mj-image src="assets/ezovion-dashboard-still.png" alt="Ezovion HIMS dashboard on tablet and mobile" width="285px" align="right" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="0 28px 12px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-raw>
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="pair-cell pair-cell-first" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/pill.png" alt="Medicine" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Live EHR Stock by Medicine ID:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Verify pharmacy stock directly at the point of care to prevent treatment delays.</div>
                </td>
                <td class="pair-cell" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/receipt.png" alt="Billing" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">IP Bill Estimates &amp; Payments:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Offer upfront inpatient cost clarity and accept RTGS, NEFT, IMPS, and payment cheques seamlessly.</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-raw>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="0 28px 12px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-raw>
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="pair-cell pair-cell-first" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/clipboard-text.png" alt="Audit" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Auditing &amp; Referral Tracking:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Consolidate IP and advance ledgers while auto-capturing referral doctors in service bills for faster, cleaner audits.</div>
                </td>
                <td class="pair-cell" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/heartbeat.png" alt="Diabetes care" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Diabetes Care Management:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Enable end-to-end chronic care with dedicated mobile apps, patient portals, and integrated device support for superior long-term clinical outcomes.</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-raw>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="0 28px 12px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-raw>
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="pair-cell pair-cell-first" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/pulse.png" alt="Vital monitoring" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Vital Monitoring Device Integration:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Streamline point-of-care diagnostics by feeding patient vitals directly from medical hardware into the EHR, eliminating manual chart entry errors.</div>
                </td>
                <td class="pair-cell" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/chart-line-up.png" alt="Revenue cycle management" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Revenue Cycle Management (RCM):</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Accelerate collections and minimize claim leakage with automated billing validation, faster approvals, and structured denial tracking.</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-raw>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="0 28px 32px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-raw>
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="pair-cell pair-cell-first" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/users-three.png" alt="Second opinion" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Wellspring:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">An initiative to make an easy move for your patients to find a better second opinion and advisory effortlessly.</div>
                </td>
                <td class="pair-cell" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/arrows-clockwise.png" alt="Accounting integration" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:23px;padding:0 0 8px;">Tally Integration:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Bridge operational billing and core accounting automatically, syncing hospital revenue and expense data without repetitive double-entry.</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-raw>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="36px 34px 18px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" line-height="34px">What This Delivers for You</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="0 18px 12px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 6px 20px" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-image src="assets/delivery-stock.jpg" alt="Clinician and pharmacist reviewing medicine stock" width="264px" padding="0 0 18px" />
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" line-height="24px" padding="0 18px 8px">Zero Prescription Friction:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" padding="0 18px">Clinicians prescribe only what is in stock, cutting pharmacy callbacks and speeding up bed turnaround.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 6px 20px">
          <mj-image src="assets/delivery-billing.jpg" alt="Hospital admissions team discussing patient billing" width="264px" padding="0 0 18px" />
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" line-height="24px" padding="0 18px 8px">Predictable Patient Billing:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" padding="0 18px">Transparent cost estimates and consolidated payment ledgers minimize discharge-day billing disputes.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#fce8fa" padding="0 18px 38px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 6px 20px" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-image src="assets/delivery-fiscal.jpg" alt="Healthcare finance team reviewing hospital records" width="264px" padding="0 0 18px" />
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" line-height="24px" padding="0 18px 8px">Automated Fiscal Integrity:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" padding="0 18px">Direct Tally synchronization and auto-populated referral logs ensure airtight accounting books and effortless regulatory compliance.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 6px 20px">
          <mj-image src="assets/delivery-vitals.jpg" alt="Nurse checking a patient’s bedside vital signs" width="264px" padding="0 0 18px" />
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" line-height="24px" padding="0 18px 8px">Continuous Bedside Accuracy:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" padding="0 18px">Auto-captured vitals free nursing bandwidth, keeping clinical focus firmly on patient recovery rather than administrative paperwork.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-url="assets/ai-intelligence-banner.jpg" background-size="cover" background-position="left center" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding="38px 34px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="16%" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-image src="assets/icons/brain-light.png" alt="Artificial intelligence" width="50px" align="left" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="84%">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" line-height="34px">AI Innovations and Intelligent Suite</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#621742" padding="14px 34px 18px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 14px 18px 0" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="7px">HealIQ:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="14px" line-height="22px">Tracks, visualizes, and manages longitudinal health metrics over time to convert routine clinical data into goal-oriented patient journeys.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 0 18px 14px">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="7px">VizIQ:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="14px" line-height="22px">Unifies a patient's complete multi-visit medical history into a single view to highlight recurring patterns, treatment trends, and hidden clinical risks.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#621742" padding="0 34px 18px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 14px 18px 0" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="7px">GlucoIQ:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="14px" line-height="22px">Predicts long-term blood glucose trends from historical lab data to enable proactive, early intervention in chronic diabetes care.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 0 18px 14px">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="7px">InterpretIQ:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="14px" line-height="22px">Automatically analyzes historical pathology reports to generate test-wise trend charts that reveal health progression without manual record reviews.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section background-color="#621742" padding="0 34px 28px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 14px 18px 0" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="7px">Conversational AI:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="14px" line-height="22px">Listens to patient-doctor dialogues in real time and automatically structures them into precise clinical notes to eliminate manual documentation.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="50%" padding="0 0 18px 14px">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="7px">Symptoms Checker:</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="14px" line-height="22px">Evaluates patient-reported symptoms prior to consultation to determine triage urgency, suggest probable conditions, and route cases to the right specialist.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-url="assets/global-trust-banner.jpg" background-size="cover" background-position="center" background-repeat="no-repeat" padding="44px 34px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="29px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" line-height="35px">Deployments, Expansion &amp; Compliance</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="28px 24px 12px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-raw>
            <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
              <tr>
                <td class="pair-cell pair-cell-first" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#fce8fa" style="padding:20px 18px;">
                  <img src="assets/icons/buildings.png" alt="Hospital deployments" width="34" style="display:block;border:0;width:34px;height:auto;margin:0 0 14px;" />
                  <div style="color:#621742;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;padding:0 0 8px;">Active Deployments:</div>
                  <div style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Pilots underway at 2000 bed government hospital and a 100 bedded hospital in Nepal.<br />Hospital, and lab automation for Integrity Medical Services.</div>
                </td>
                <td class="pair-cell" width="50%" valign="top" bgcolor="#2d2d2d" style="padding:20px 18px;">
