                  <div style="color:#fce8fa;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;padding:0 0 8px;">Global Footprint:</div>
                  <div style="color:#ffffff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Accelerating presence across Saudi Arabia, the UAE, Indonesia, Trinidad &amp; Tobago, and Europe.</div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </mj-raw>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="0 24px 12px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column background-color="#ffffff" padding="24px 20px">
          <mj-image src="assets/icons/handshake.png" alt="Ecosystem partnerships" width="34px" align="left" padding="0 0 14px" />
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="18px" font-weight="700" line-height="24px" padding-bottom="8px">Ecosystem Milestones:</mj-text>
          <mj-image src="assets/ecosystem-mindcare-launch.jpg" alt="MindCare by ZILOY official launch event" width="512px" padding="0 0 18px" />
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="14px" line-height="21px" padding-bottom="15px">QuantumNexis marked an important ecosystem milestone with the official launch of MindCare by ZILOY on the Touch 'n Go eWallet. The event brought the teams and ecosystem partners together to celebrate the launch and their shared progress toward more connected, accessible digital healthcare.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#621742" padding="36px 34px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column width="15%" css-class="mobile-gap">
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-family="Georgia, Times, serif" font-size="58px" line-height="48px">“</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="85%">
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="25px" font-weight="700" line-height="31px" padding-bottom="15px">What Our Client Says</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-family="Georgia, Times, serif" font-size="18px" line-height="28px" padding-bottom="18px">“It's been two years of using Ezovion HIMS in DMR Hospital and It was a great experience as the team is too supportive and available 24X7 for help. Ezovion is the complete solution that includes all the advanced features and options at very reasonable prices. DMR Hospital Highly recommend the Ezovion HIMS.”</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#ffffff" font-size="14px" font-weight="700" padding-bottom="2px">Tanishq Chaudhary</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#fce8fa" font-size="13px">Admin, DMR Hospital</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section padding="38px 34px 14px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" line-height="34px">Our Latest Publishes-</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      <mj-section padding="0 34px 34px" css-class="mobile-pad">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" role="presentation">
            <tr><td width="32" style="padding:15px 10px 15px 0;color:#621742;font-weight:bold;">01</td><td class="article-link" style="padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #fce8fa;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;font-weight:bold;"><a href="https://ezovion.com/software-requirements-specification-for-hospital-management-system/">Software Requirements Specification for Hospital Management System</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" style="padding:15px 10px 15px 0;color:#621742;font-weight:bold;">02</td><td class="article-link" style="padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #fce8fa;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;font-weight:bold;"><a href="https://ezovion.com/claim-denial-management-solutions/">Claim Denial Management: 7 Common Denials &amp; Solutions</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" style="padding:15px 10px 15px 0;color:#621742;font-weight:bold;">03</td><td class="article-link" style="padding:15px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #fce8fa;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;font-weight:bold;"><a href="https://ezovion.com/history-of-emr-systems/">History of Electronic Medical Record (EMR) Systems</a></td></tr>
            <tr><td width="32" style="padding:15px 10px 15px 0;color:#621742;font-weight:bold;">04</td><td class="article-link" style="padding:15px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:23px;font-weight:bold;"><a href="https://ezovion.com/how-clinic-management-software-analytics-helps-leaders-find-hidden-inefficiencies/">Clinic Management Software to Uncover Hidden Inefficiencies!</a></td></tr>
          </mj-table>
        </mj-column>
