          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="28px" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="-0.5px" line-height="34px" padding-bottom="18px">What’s Coming Next: PACS &amp; WoundCare on the Horizon</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" padding-bottom="14px">We are thrilled to announce that two major clinical additions, PACS and WoundCare, have successfully completed core feature development and clinical workflow validation.</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" padding-bottom="14px">Our product and engineering teams are currently conducting final cloud verification, stress-testing performance, and fine-tuning reliability to deliver an exceptional user experience.</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#2d2d2d" padding-bottom="14px"><strong>What to watch for:</strong> With final checks now underway, both applications will be heading into their official production release very soon. Stay tuned for rollout details!</mj-text>
          <mj-text color="#621742" font-size="17px" font-weight="700" line-height="25px">Together, we are shaping for the future of connected healthcare. Thank you for trusting Ezovion to power your hospital's growth and patient care.</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
